    <h2>The Holiday Blizzard — Why It Works</h2>
  <p>Hot cocoa and peppermint is one of the most universally loved winter flavor combinations. DQ translates it into a cold format surprisingly well: hot cocoa-flavored pieces deliver a rich, chocolatey depth, while peppermint candy adds the cool, refreshing holiday mint note. In vanilla soft serve, the combination is festive, familiar, and genuinely enjoyable even at cold temperatures. See all Blizzard flavors at <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

  <h2>Peppermint Hot Cocoa vs. Other Winter Treats</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Mini Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Peppermint Hot Cocoa Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~480</td><td>Cocoa + mint — classic holiday combo</td></tr><tr><td>Oreo® Cookie Blizzard (year-round)</td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>420</td><td>Classic year-round alternative</td></tr><tr><td>Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>510</td><td>Intense chocolate, no mint</td></tr><tr><td>Brownie Batter Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>530</td><td>Chocolate, year-round, no seasonal premium</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>When to Order the Peppermint Hot Cocoa Blizzard</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Holiday gatherings</strong> — A festive alternative to standard desserts. Order a round of Peppermint Hot Cocoa Blizzards instead of hot cocoa for a cold-weather party twist.</li>
    <li><strong>Gift card pairing</strong> — DQ gift cards are popular holiday gifts. A Peppermint Hot Cocoa Blizzard is the natural pairing for a DQ holiday gift card visit.</li>
    <li><strong>Early November through January</strong> — Do not wait — seasonal flavors sell out or rotate off before the advertised end date at some locations.</li>
    <li><strong>Order the Mini first</strong> — At $3.99, the Mini lets you try the holiday flavor before committing to a Large at $6.49.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Availability Note</h2>
  <p>The Peppermint Hot Cocoa Blizzard is a winter seasonal item and is not available at all DQ locations. Always check the DQ app or call your <a href="/locations">local DQ location</a> to confirm current availability before visiting specifically for this flavor.</p>

